   "lines": [
    "We travelled all",
    "last night, reaching",
    "Matawaumkeag at",
    "10.30, and from",
    "there took ~~the~~ a",
    "buckboard and",
    "reached here",
    "(~~Highland~~ Island",
    "Falls) at 8. p.m.",
    "Whenever I think",
    "about poor old",
    "Hal Minot I feel",
    "very sad; he was",
    "such a loveable man.",
    "Have a pretty bad",
    "attack of asthma; I",
    "miss riding my horse; he",
    "has not been unwell a",
    "day this summer."
   ],
